	(descr "Eaton Bussmann SCF9550 self-control fuse (SCF9550-30-05 and its family), body 9.5 x 5.0 x 2.0 mm. LAND REVIEW: Eaton's own recommended pad layout, Technical Data ELX1135 (January 2022) page 3, pad for pad; pins from page 1 (1 and 2 the fuse ends on the long edges, 3 the heater on the short edge). Pads 1 and 2: 7.40 x 1.40 at y -+2.05 (inner edges 1.35 from centre); pad 3: 3.00 tall at x -5.95, 0.75 straight then a 1.40 taper to a 0.70 tip at x -3.80. Read back from pcbnew on the KiCad box, 26 Sep 2026")
